    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSuperbly positioned on one of Bagenalstown's primary high-footfall thoroughfares, this versatile vacant unit offers an exceptional opportunity for business owners, developers, and investors alike.\n\nCurrently configured for commercial use, the property commands excellent visibility and profits from a consistently high volume of passing vehicular and pedestrian traffic. Its strategic location places it less than a five-minute walk from Bagenalstown Train Station, ensuring superb connectivity for staff, clients, or customers.\n\nFor those looking to pivot the property's use, this unit is an ideal candidate for residential conversion. Benefiting from current fast-tracked planning legislation for change of use, transitioning this property into a high demand town centre residential unit is a highly viable and straightforward option.\n\nEqually suited for retail/office operations or residential redevelopment. Full details regarding commercial rates and projected rental yields are available upon request.\n\nViewings come highly recommended to appreciate the full potential of this property.\n\nContact Sherry FitzGerald McDermott today to arrange your appointment."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 1.0 x 1.8\nCarpeted. Light fitting.\n\nReception Room - 3.8 x 2.9\nCarpeted.\n\nInner hallway - 3.0 x 0.8\nLight fitting. Carpeted.\n\nW.C. - 0.9 x 2.9\nLyno flooring. Light fitting. W.C. Wash hand basin.\n\nRoom 1 - 5.2 x 4.1\nLyno flooring. Fitted floor units. Blind. Light fitting. Door to rear.\n\nStairwell - 2.6 x 0.7\nCarpeted.\n\nRoom 2 - 5.2 x 2.4\nCarpeted.\n\nRoom 3 - 4.1 x 3.0\nLyno flooring. P.V.C. on walls. Light fitting.\n\nRoom 4 - 4.1 x 4.0\nCarpeted. Light fitting.\n\n"
      },
